        "r": 539.9970719999995,
        "b": 654.3477210491803
      },
      "content": "This section contains safety and equipment precautions, required tools and materials, and step-by-step procedures for replacing parts in the infuser. Unless otherwise stated, always perform the PVT after a replacement procedure."
    },
    {
